{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_03_000_22_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fc20c729034e6567da8257055de64dc2f343d2a1381fd2a60598cb3b1eff172b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:068a5a7167425520111a475f93994527c79038e9d37bcce89d1ac99fe116b597",
      "text": "新成员？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9883dd20cc0bfa026b06ef215a1a0fa2d8bff806f62129968a9c28aa97ca6843",
      "text": "梦境般豪华的舞台。\n正看着会场的光景沉浸在感慨中时，\n某位偶像向自己搭了话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:068a5a7167425520111a475f93994527c79038e9d37bcce89d1ac99fe116b597",
      "text": "新成员？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72dde779dfc4dbcbba5a98289159b4d0f199e7afc26d0550e1ffd960122adc79",
      "text": "（宽广的会场、座无虚席的观众席、豪华的布景……\n简直就像在做梦一样……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86275e8108cd7a461455caa61115847e8db637be293e82e01258849189f68e96",
      "text": "（不，能在这么棒的舞台上，\n举办偶像们的演唱会什么的……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:439a80ec4228fd0ffed3b0abc321892189d34e586dcbfc313787961daf4d1807",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，这就已经感慨万千\n了吗。这可不行，快拿这个擦擦眼泪吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f14c6c6e263db50f18c0238d8fff323be338b7a47df21b50f4efe5092781217a",
      "text": "谢谢您。回想起从和大家相遇\n直到今天的种种，不由得就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65ca11125760d0da9680b74a52fe90f7b8ef57b7f7c2a23321c00e3d0a32e85b",
      "text": "现在回头看还太早了！好戏才正要开场呢。\n那份PASSION还是先留在心里为好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ec7ae91343bf6cd77f214c6ecb52993c81f1431c147d5ab1e48fe185a5ae6ec",
      "text": "好的，我会的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91495e2eb66d9d9f40daa2d69b833b6dd3da7d123631d871c5cf6b781e808bb9",
      "text": "很有精神的回答！\n那么，我去去就来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b54d203a5bc8cfe8a7bb93acadac6ffc87b91ca7891ee906ac14425b87335642",
      "text": "让我们把聚集在会场的粉丝们，\n狠狠地带动起来吧！PASSION！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c5180f396c5ddd466d538731df7a17fb87807bb344ff1a226aa0438e539031",
      "text": "嘿，干劲很足嘛。\n我们也不能认输啊，天道先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3",
      "text": "啊啊，那是当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dd07f13c53c12285f13d6eb601f9a0daf1cbd0c0db6fe00319dddafec53af0e",
      "text": "制作人。\n我们要献上最棒的舞台，就在那里看好吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77e027b8eec65bfe53265167835bdecc614dccfec2e1ed870161d64d45ce064f",
      "text": "好的，路上小心！\n我会在这里守护着大家的英姿的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
